Subtask 4.3: Create Monitoring Script
Create a script to monitor Prometheus health:

nano prometheus-health-check.sh
Add the following script:

#!/bin/bash

echo "=== Prometheus Health Check ==="
echo "Date: $(date)"
echo

# Check if Prometheus is running
echo "1. Checking Prometheus service status:"
systemctl is-active prometheus
echo

# Check if Prometheus port is listening
echo "2. Checking if Prometheus port 9090 is listening:"
netstat -tlnp | grep :9090 || echo "Port 9090 not listening"
echo

# Check Prometheus API health
echo "3. Checking Prometheus API health:"
curl -s http://localhost:9090/-/healthy || echo "API health check failed"
