Subtask 4.4: Troubleshoot Common Issues
Create scenarios for common issues and their solutions:

# Create a script that simulates common problems
nano simulate-problems.sh
Add the following content:

#!/bin/bash

echo "Simulating common Prometheus problems..."

# Problem 1: Configuration file permissions
echo "1. Testing configuration file permission issues:"
sudo chmod 600 /etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml
sudo systemctl restart prometheus
sleep 5
sudo systemctl status prometheus
echo "Fix: Restore proper permissions"
